  "specId": "307-stop-creating-presets-template",
  "issue": 401,
  "request": "Goal: Stop senti upgrade from generating unused project-local .senti/templates/<lang>/docs/creating_presets.md files.\nScope: Update deployPresetCopies generation targets and regression coverage so standard upgrade keeps syncing base guardrail managed copies but does not create or manage project-local creating_presets.md.\nOut of Scope: Do not change creating_presets.md content, guardrail-rewrite-rubric.md content, or preset chapter validation semantics.\nDescription: Issue #401 reports that deployPresetCopies unconditionally writes .senti/templates/<lang>/docs/creating_presets.md. Base preset chapters do not reference this file, so preset validation emits creating_presets.md not listed in chapters after upgrade. The fix should remove that generated target, preserve base guardrail copy syncing, and document via spec or test that existing project-local creating_presets.md files are user-owned.",
